@tablet 
@obverse 
1. _1(esze3) GAN2 a-sza3 a-gar3_ t,a3-bu 
#tr.ts: ištēn ebel eqlum ugārum ṭābu(m)
#tr.en: A field of 1 eblu in the "Good" meadow

2. i-ta _a-sza3 dumu-munus lugal_ 
#tr.ts: itā eqel mārat šarrim
#tr.en: adjacent to the field of the king’s daughter,

3. _sag-bi 1(disz)-kam i7_ pa-ri-ik-tum 
#tr.ts: pūssu maḫrītum pariktum
#tr.en: its first front is the transversal canal,

4. _ki_ me-lu-la-tum _lukur {d}utu_ 
#tr.ts: itti mēlūlatum nadīt šamaš
#tr.en: from Mēlūlatum nadītu of Šamaš

5. _dumu-munus_ ip-qu2-sza 
#tr.ts: mārat ipquša
#tr.en: daughter of Ipquša,

6. be-el-ti _a-sza3_ 
#tr.ts: bēlti eqlim
#tr.en: the owner of the field,

7. {disz}il-ta-ni _dumu-munus lugal_ 
#tr.ts: iltani mārat šarrim
#tr.en: Iltani, the king’s daughter,

8. _a-sza3_ a-na er-re-szu-tim 
#tr.ts: eqlam ana errēšūtim
#tr.en: the field in tenancy

9. a-na _gu2-un_ 
#tr.ts: ana biltim
#tr.en: for rent

10. u2-sze-s,i# 
#tr.ts: ušēṣi
#tr.en: has rented.

11. _u4 buru14-[sze3]_ 
#tr.ts: ina ūm ebūrim
#tr.en: At harvest time,

@reverse 
1. _1(bur3) GAN2-e 6(asz) sze gur {gesz}ban2 {d}utu_ 
#tr.ts: ana ištēn būrim šeššet kur âm šūt šamaš
#tr.en: 6 kor of barley of the vessel of Šamaš for 1 BUR

2. i-na _kar zimbir{ki}_ 
#tr.ts: ina kār sippir
#tr.en: at the harbour of Sippar

3. _i3-ag2-e_ 
#tr.ts: imaddad
#tr.en: she will pay (lit. measure out).

$ single ruling 
4. _igi_ e-t,e-[rum _dumu_ an]-pi2?-sza? 
#tr.ts: maḫar ēṭerum mār anum-pîša
#tr.en: Before Ēṭerum son of Anum-pîša;

